# Copy to .env.local for local development, or add these in
# Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
#
# Auto Price is OFF unless BOTH values are set. Leave them empty to run the
# app in Manual Price mode only (fully functional, no external services).
#
# These are server-only variables (no NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix), so the API key is
# never sent to the browser.
#
# IMPORTANT: Before enabling, confirm that your provider's plan permits the
# way you will display prices (e.g. sharing the site with friends).
# See README → "Auto Price and data licensing".

STOCK_PRICE_PROVIDER=
FINNHUB_API_KEY=
